{"content_hash": "31f9dab5bc936929", "version_id": 773, "article_id": 78, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Jokić tells booing fans to stay away as Nuggets win", "title_zh": "约基奇让嘘球队的球迷别再来了，掘金照样赢球", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/jokic-says-booing-fans-not-welcome-after-nuggets-rally-from-23-points-down-to-beat-pelicans", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722653-c611b7f78c32?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGpva2klMjBib29pbmclMjBmYW5zfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTI5NzA4NDV8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-in-blue-and-white-uniform-on-stadium-_zukO8E8-bY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(325, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(3, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "219d721cfe25"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-26", "word_count": 152, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Denver came back from 23 points down to beat New Orleans in overtime on Saturday. After the game, Nikola Jokić had strong words for fans who booed the team at half-time.", "lead_zh": "周六，丹佛掘金在落后23分的情况下加时逆转击败新奥尔良鹈鹕。赛后，尼古拉·约基奇对半场时嘘球队的球迷说了重话。", "preview": "Jokić scored 35 points and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists, although Denver was missing several players. He scored eight of his points in o", "preview_zh": "约基奇砍下35分，外加15个篮板和10次助攻，尽管掘金缺了好几名球员。他在加时赛独得8分，帮助球队以141比135取胜。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 763, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 57.3, "size_bytes": 344736, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 184, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 58.825, "size_bytes": 353952, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 184, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 62.2, "size_bytes": 374112, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 184, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 54.1, "size_bytes": 325584, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 184, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 58.175, "size_bytes": 350064, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 184, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@91b304e/content/data/versions/773.json", "paragraphs": ["Jokić scored 35 points and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists, although Denver was missing several players. He scored eight of his points in overtime, and the Nuggets won 141-135. It was his 199th career triple-double in the regular season.", "The home crowd booed when Denver went into half-time 73-57 down. Jokić was not happy about it. “Those fans who booed us, they don’t need to come anymore,” he said. “If you follow us, you know that we never quit.”", "Jamal Murray scored 42 points, and rookie Trevon Brazille added 17 in his home debut. New Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half, but Denver fought back with three-pointers and a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon. Murray then tied the game with free throws.", "Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, while Dejounte Murray had 22. The Pelicans have now lost their first three games under new coach Jamahl Mosley."], "paragraphs_zh": ["约基奇砍下35分，外加15个篮板和10次助攻，尽管掘金缺了好几名球员。他在加时赛独得8分，帮助球队以141比135取胜。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双。", "半场结束时掘金以57比73落后，主场球迷发出了嘘声。约基奇对此很不满。“那些嘘我们的球迷，以后不用来了，”他说，“如果你一直关注我们，就知道我们从不放弃。”", "贾马尔·穆雷得到42分，新秀特雷冯·布拉齐尔主场首秀贡献17分。鹈鹕上半场命中率高达65.9%，但掘金靠三分球和阿隆·戈登的反手扣篮追了回来。随后穆雷用罚球扳平比分。", "特雷·墨菲三世为鹈鹕拿下26分，德章泰·穆雷得到22分。鹈鹕在新帅贾马尔·莫斯利手下已经连输三场。"], "body": "Jokić scored 35 points and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists, although Denver was missing several players. He scored eight of his points in overtime, and the Nuggets won 141-135. It was his 199th career triple-double in the regular season.\n\nThe home crowd booed when Denver went into half-time 73-57 down. Jokić was not happy about it. “Those fans who booed us, they don’t need to come anymore,” he said. “If you follow us, you know that we never quit.”\n\nJamal Murray scored 42 points, and rookie Trevon Brazille added 17 in his home debut. New Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half, but Denver fought back with three-pointers and a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon. Murray then tied the game with free throws.\n\nTrey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, while Dejounte Murray had 22. The Pelicans have now lost their first three games under new coach Jamahl Mosley.", "body_zh": "约基奇砍下35分，外加15个篮板和10次助攻，尽管掘金缺了好几名球员。他在加时赛独得8分，帮助球队以141比135取胜。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双。\n\n半场结束时掘金以57比73落后，主场球迷发出了嘘声。约基奇对此很不满。“那些嘘我们的球迷，以后不用来了，”他说，“如果你一直关注我们，就知道我们从不放弃。”\n\n贾马尔·穆雷得到42分，新秀特雷冯·布拉齐尔主场首秀贡献17分。鹈鹕上半场命中率高达65.9%，但掘金靠三分球和阿隆·戈登的反手扣篮追了回来。随后穆雷用罚球扳平比分。\n\n特雷·墨菲三世为鹈鹕拿下26分，德章泰·穆雷得到22分。鹈鹕在新帅贾马尔·莫斯利手下已经连输三场。", "text": "Jokić scored 35 points and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists, although Denver was missing several players. He scored eight of his points in overtime, and the Nuggets won 141-135. It was his 199th career triple-double in the regular season. The home crowd booed when Denver went into half-time 73-57 down. Jokić was not happy about it. “Those fans who booed us, they don’t need to come anymore,” he said. “If you follow us, you know that we never quit.” Jamal Murray scored 42 points, and rookie Trevon Brazille added 17 in his home debut. New Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half, but Denver fought back with three-pointers and a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon. Murray then tied the game with free throws. Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, while Dejounte Murray had 22. The Pelicans have now lost their first three games under new coach Jamahl Mosley.", "vocab": [{"word": "boo", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发出嘘声", "note": "球迷表达不满时常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rally", "pos": "verb", "zh": "逆转；奋起直追", "note": "常与 from behind 连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "overtime", "pos": "noun", "zh": "加时赛", "note": "体育比赛常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "triple-double", "pos": "noun", "zh": "三双", "note": "篮球术语，三项数据上双", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rebound", "pos": "noun", "zh": "篮板球", "note": "篮球统计用语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "assist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "助攻", "note": "篮球统计用语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rookie", "pos": "noun", "zh": "新秀", "note": "指第一年打职业比赛的球员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "debut", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首秀", "note": "home debut 即主场首秀", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "displeasure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "不满", "note": "比 anger 更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "erase the deficit", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "抹平分差", "note": "deficit 指落后分数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-25T23:27:24.188772", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Joki", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.645, "sm": 325, "em": 644, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "ć", "s": 0.645, "e": 0.725, "sm": 644, "em": 724, "cs": 4, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "scored", "s":